Recently, I've been thinking a bit about the power of two-weaponing,
and how it tends to destroy some variety with combat classes.  One
possible balancing idea that I came up with would be to disallow
two-weapon combat with any artifacts.  This would make shields useful
again, as they would become more attractive to combat classes that
want to wield artifacts.  It'd also make the Tsurugi more interesting,
as it isn't quite so overshadowed by the other possibilities. 
Finally, I think it'd give people a somewhat more difficult choice to
make, choosing between the power granted by two-weaponing, or the
ability to use an artifact weapon.

Any suggestions, comments, concerns?

